  words:
  - queen
  info: 'Insect queens, also known as gynes are the primary female reproductive caste
    of social insects. They are essential to the colony''s survival, as their main
    goal is to produce offspring while other members work to protect and sustain
    them. There can be one or more queens in a colony, depending on species.


    Source:
    https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gyne '
